.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-pages - Manage your storefront pages


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad pages [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage your storefront pages: the slugged pages that serve under your store at /\&.

.PP
The special slug "profile" is your profile landing page (your store's home page); \fBpages push profile\fR replaces it with custom HTML the same way \fBuser page publish\fR does.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for pages


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad pages list
  gumroad pages create --title "About" --slug about
  gumroad pages create --title "About" ./about.html
  gumroad pages pull about
  gumroad pages scaffold about
  gumroad pages push about ./about.html
  gumroad pages push profile ./landing.html
  gumroad pages preview ./about.html
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-pages-create(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-pages-list(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-pages-preview(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-pages-pull(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-pages-push(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-pages-scaffold(1)\fP
